          "blocks": {
            "text_kM4tjV": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Since 2016, IndyVogue has brought Silk Mark Certified pure silk and handloom sarees — Banarasi, Kanjeevaram, Baluchari, Jamdani — from the weavers of Kolkata to more than <strong>10,000 patrons</strong> worldwide, with <strong>700+ verified 5-star reviews</strong> behind us.</p><p>As a US-based, woman-owned small business, we source directly from the artisans who make each piece. Every saree is a single piece, never restocked — when it's gone, it's gone.</p><p>Free shipping over $75, duties covered, and personal help whenever you want it. We will win your heart.</p>",
